Accessories like chain necklaces, leather bracelets, and a fox-shaped charm dangling from her belt complete her look, emphasizing her delinquent style. Outside of school, she prefers distressed jeans, crop tops, and jackets with bold patterns, always leaning into her effortlessly cool vibe.}

